Subject: [PATCH] vesembedded: add experimental Akai CD3000i

CD3000i is provided by the existing upstream akai/s3000.cpp translation unit
and shares its floppy connector and image-device option with the other selected
Akai samplers.  Add only its lexically sorted embedded driver-registry entries.

diff --git a/src/ves/embeddedinstruments/EmbeddedEmulatorEngine.cpp b/src/ves/embeddedinstruments/EmbeddedEmulatorEngine.cpp
--- a/src/ves/embeddedinstruments/EmbeddedEmulatorEngine.cpp
+++ b/src/ves/embeddedinstruments/EmbeddedEmulatorEngine.cpp
@@ -35,5 +35,6 @@ GAME_EXTERN(vfxsd);
 
 GAME_EXTERN(ap10);
+GAME_EXTERN(cd3000i);
 GAME_EXTERN(cd3000xl);
 GAME_EXTERN(ct8000);
 GAME_EXTERN(ctfk1);
@@ -77,6 +78,7 @@ const game_driver *const driver_list::s_drivers_sorted[] =
 {
 	&GAME_NAME(___empty),
 	&GAME_NAME(ap10),
+	&GAME_NAME(cd3000i),
 	&GAME_NAME(cd3000xl),
 	&GAME_NAME(ct8000),
 	&GAME_NAME(ctfk1),
